WEBVTT

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:19.290
Everyone! I have some really big
and surprising news!

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:25.500
You won't believe it!
ChamJam will be performing in an idol festival!

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.370
Huh?

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:30.580
Silence...

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:32.500
What do we do? We already knew that.

00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:35.540
Their management's just too slow...

00:00:35.540 --> 00:00:39.370
We can't tell them that we found out
because other artists retweeted the info.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:43.910
H-Huh? Was that not really good news?

00:00:43.910 --> 00:00:46.160
We had no idea!

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.790
Amazing! We'll definitely be there!

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.370
I'll be there one million times!

00:00:52.120 --> 00:00:56.200
That information definitely got leaked somewhere.
Probably through social media.

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:57.910
Don't sweat the small stuff!

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:01.750
Yeah, it's a festival!
Being invited to this is a big chance for us!

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:04.700
I'm happy, but the venue's huge, isn't it?

00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:06.330
I'm scared...

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:10.040
There are other popular groups from
other prefectures that are invited, right?

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:12.410
We're definitely not that famous...

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:14.910
Who knows if they'll like us or not...

00:01:14.910 --> 00:01:17.580
It is scary. But...

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:21.950
Once we get past this,
the Budokan will be waiting for us.

00:01:21.950 --> 00:01:22.950
Yeah.

00:01:23.870 --> 00:01:25.620
The Budokan's so far away!

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:27.950
Yeah! And it's an expensive train trip!

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:30.660
That's not the problem here.

00:01:30.660 --> 00:01:31.700
Oh, Yuka.

00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:34.120
The Budokan, huh...

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:09.330
Hello, everyone in Okayama
and Kagawa Prefectures.

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:11.500
I'm Maki Hakata from ChamJam.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:15.410
"The Closest Miracle to Me"
Now Maki's been on TV following Reo!

00:03:15.410 --> 00:03:18.040
The front row sure gets treated differently.

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:20.870
Oho? Does that mean Maina's
going to make her TV debut soon?

00:03:20.870 --> 00:03:23.120
I mean, she made it to the front row once!

00:03:23.120 --> 00:03:24.450
Not that I got to see it.

00:03:24.450 --> 00:03:26.330
Eripiyo's never going to let go of this.

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:27.910
Hey, look!

00:03:27.910 --> 00:03:30.450
"The 16th Setouchi Idol Festival"
My group, ChamJam,

00:03:30.450 --> 00:03:32.910
"The 16th Setouchi Idol Festival"
will be appearing in an upcoming festival.

00:03:32.910 --> 00:03:35.040
I hope you all come to see us!

00:03:35.040 --> 00:03:36.910
Wow, she's doing a great job
of promoting the group.

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:40.250
Cham is really going to be in this festival!

00:03:40.250 --> 00:03:44.410
"Maple Doll Confirmed to Appear!"
They're really pushing this Maple Doll.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:48.080
Well, they're the top-billed
idol group at this festival.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:51.580
They're from Hiroshima,
but they've already made their major label debut.

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:54.620
They even hold a concert in Tokyo once a month.

00:03:54.620 --> 00:03:55.950
Huh...

00:03:55.950 --> 00:03:59.000
I only ever cared about where Maina
was performing, so I had no idea.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.080
The center, Mei...

00:04:02.080 --> 00:04:05.620
...was also the center in Reo's old group.

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:07.450
What? That's news to me!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:11.450
At the time, Yoshimune invited me
to one of their shows.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:18.290
Yoshimune was a Mei fan,
so I lined up for Mei just that one time.

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:44.580
Reo just can't seem to forget about that time...

00:04:44.580 --> 00:04:48.330
No matter how loyal I am to Reo right now!

00:04:48.330 --> 00:04:52.950
I'm jealous that you've known
about Reo so long, Kumasa.

00:04:52.950 --> 00:04:57.200
Er... Apparently my sense of despair
got lost somewhere.

00:04:57.200 --> 00:05:00.080
Not only did I not see Maina in the front row,

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:04.160
I didn't even see Maina
when she first stood on stage.

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:07.750
It makes me sad that there are
sides to Maina I don't know.

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:09.290
--Goo goo, ga ga.
--I didn't get to celebrate her first
birthday or her <i>Shichi-Go-San</i>.

00:05:09.290 --> 00:05:12.540
--I didn't get to celebrate her first
birthday or her <i>Shichi-Go-San</i>.

00:05:12.540 --> 00:05:16.040
I don't even know if she cried
at her primary school graduation.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:19.500
Why didn't I give birth to Maina myself?

00:05:19.500 --> 00:05:24.120
If I'd given birth to her, I'd literally been
able to be her fan from her birth!

00:05:24.120 --> 00:05:28.620
B-By the way, Kumasa,
what are idol festivals like?

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:30.120
I've never been to one.

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:33.660
Well, I mean, it is a fun event...

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.790
Wait, did you guys not sense my despair there?

00:05:36.790 --> 00:05:41.790
How do I put this... You'll be forced
to see some truths about your fave.

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:42.830
Huh?

00:05:42.830 --> 00:05:48.290
For example, you'll think about how hard
it is to get to where Maple is now.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:56.330
Or that the Budokan is a dream within a dream...

00:06:03.450 --> 00:06:06.580
A-ya! What are you watching?

00:06:06.580 --> 00:06:08.540
Oh, yeah. I forgot.

00:06:08.540 --> 00:06:10.160
"A Kagawa Specialty Filled with Tradition" "Nakayama"
I brought a gift from Kagawa.

00:06:10.160 --> 00:06:10.870
Yay!

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:14.620
Wait, did I really need to?
I bought it because you guys asked...

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:16.000
Kagawa's basically next door.

00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.830
Souvenirs are important.

00:06:17.830 --> 00:06:20.160
It's always nice to get one.

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:21.870
I wonder what it is!

00:06:22.830 --> 00:06:25.330
"Super Fresh Udon Noodles"
Udon?!

00:06:25.330 --> 00:06:27.370
Of course it is...

00:06:27.370 --> 00:06:29.830
But when are we supposed to parboil it?

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:32.080
We have our special fan event after this.

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.540
Well, we appear in order
for the special fan event.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:37.160
So one of the later people should boil them!

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:42.290
But we'll get called suddenly, and by the time
we get back to the greenroom, it'll be soggy.

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:43.410
More importantly,

00:06:43.410 --> 00:06:45.500
have you thought about how
we're going to boil them?

00:06:45.500 --> 00:06:47.950
Should I see if I can get
a huge pot from the office?

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:50.700
I don't think there's one here...

00:06:50.700 --> 00:06:52.200
To the 100-yen shop, then!

00:06:52.200 --> 00:06:54.330
Who's going to take the pot home with them?

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:59.330
I actually need a pot, so if you guys don't mind,
can I take it home with me?

00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:02.620
Who the heck cares about udon?!

00:07:02.620 --> 00:07:04.580
How can you guys be so carefree?

00:07:04.580 --> 00:07:06.000
Look at this!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:11.450
We were on the same level
as them when we started,

00:07:11.450 --> 00:07:15.200
but they managed to fill that
shopping mall with their audience!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.410
Their songs and dances are similar to ours,

00:07:17.410 --> 00:07:21.330
so our fans might end up switching over to them!

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:24.830
You saw how they reacted when
we said we'd be at the festival.

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:28.160
Could you guys at least sense
we're in some trouble?!

00:07:28.160 --> 00:07:30.120
Sorry, Aya...

00:07:30.120 --> 00:07:32.290
I didn't mean to make you feel like that.

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:36.290
It's not your fault, Reo!
There's no point in apologizing to me!

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:40.160
Anyway, let's spend more time
on lessons starting tomorrow!

00:07:40.160 --> 00:07:41.950
I'll go buy that pot now!

00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:51.580
"Mei Yuki"

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:55.120
"It's been a while, Reo. How are you?
Looks like we'll be at the same festival.
I look forward to seeing you."

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:13.290
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:17.620
It's fine. More people have been coming
up to you ever since you were on TV.

00:08:17.620 --> 00:08:19.450
She said she'll come to the festival, too.

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:20.660
I see.

00:08:21.950 --> 00:08:22.830
What is it?

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.120
It's nothing.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:31.370
I just got really happy seeing
so many people admire you.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:33.450
Even during the popularity ranking...

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:39.910
Then how about the loser has
to do whatever the winner says?

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:43.290
That's right! I have to listen to what you say!

00:08:43.290 --> 00:08:44.910
So you remembered.

00:08:44.910 --> 00:08:47.290
I had my mind made up a long time ago.

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.950
I was wondering when I'd ask you to do it.

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:53.950
What is it? Is it something that I can do?

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:56.620
Yeah...

00:08:56.620 --> 00:08:59.580
I think it's the right time.

00:08:59.580 --> 00:09:03.120
You need to try to surpass me from now on, Yume.

00:09:03.120 --> 00:09:07.540
Huh? I-I can't, though...

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:10.040
Then at least stand next to me.

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:13.870
It might be hard at this festival, but yeah...

00:09:14.910 --> 00:09:16.830
When we're at the Budokan.

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.330
Okay!

00:09:28.870 --> 00:09:31.580
You there! You're totally off!

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:33.370
Your dance moves need to be bigger!

00:09:33.370 --> 00:09:35.120
One more time from the top!

00:09:35.120 --> 00:09:37.330
No, no, that's not right at all!

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:43.000
"Teramoto"
So tiring...

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:44.950
This is way too tiring!

00:09:44.950 --> 00:09:48.660
You're one of our best dancers, Yuka,
so try to find some motivation!

00:09:48.660 --> 00:09:53.540
I can do basically everything
at least a little bit, but...

00:09:53.540 --> 00:09:56.540
I can't move so much all at once!

00:09:56.540 --> 00:09:58.450
--I mean, I can, but...!
--Then move!

00:10:00.330 --> 00:10:01.620
Stop yelling!

00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:26.700
Wait a beat there, then step right.

00:10:26.700 --> 00:10:29.080
Try putting your hips into it a bit more.

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:30.790
Oh, right. Got it!

00:10:37.370 --> 00:10:40.700
--♪ Even if they laugh at us and even if we cry ♪

00:10:40.700 --> 00:10:42.250
--Reo!
--♪ Even if they laugh at us and even if we cry ♪

00:10:42.250 --> 00:10:46.250
--♪ We’ll keep basking in the spotlight and continue singing ♪

00:10:46.250 --> 00:10:47.580
--Maki!
--♪ We’ll keep basking in the spotlight and continue singing ♪

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.160
--A-ya!
--♪ We’ll keep basking in the spotlight and continue singing ♪

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:58.620
♪ Yeah! Wow! OK! Yeah, yeah! ♪

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:08.040
Maina!

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:13.200
Kumasa! Cham's dancing today...

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:17.830
So, you noticed it, too?
They were way more together than usual.

00:11:17.830 --> 00:11:20.500
They must all be working hard for the festival!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.290
Yeah... Yeah!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:25.620
I'm not gonna mess around today.

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:27.790
I mean, I'm never messing around, but...

00:11:27.790 --> 00:11:29.950
Today, since Maina's working
so hard for the festival,

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:33.870
I'm gonna say the most super,
awesome, best things ever to her!

00:11:33.870 --> 00:11:35.370
Hey, Maina. Listen!

00:11:35.370 --> 00:11:36.620
O-Okay?

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:40.500
Even if I'm just another one
of your many fwans...

00:11:40.500 --> 00:11:41.500
I messed up.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:43.620
...many fans... Um...

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:46.660
To me, Maina, you're the onwy...

00:11:46.660 --> 00:11:48.620
I messed up!

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:51.200
You're the only one in the world for me!

00:11:51.200 --> 00:11:52.200
Okay...

00:11:52.200 --> 00:11:53.410
Even if at the fwesti...

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:54.370
I messed up.

00:11:54.370 --> 00:11:57.200
Um... So you see...

00:11:57.200 --> 00:11:59.910
Thank you very much!

00:11:59.910 --> 00:12:01.450
I messed up every single line.

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:04.950
Thank you... oh, so much.

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.160
Gloom...

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.620
Um, Eripiyo!

00:12:08.620 --> 00:12:12.120
No way! Maina stopped me from leaving for once!

00:12:12.120 --> 00:12:14.080
Will you come to the festival?

00:12:14.080 --> 00:12:16.450
Of course! You must be nervous about that!

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:18.950
I need to give her words of encouragement
to put her at ease!

00:12:20.410 --> 00:12:21.950
Of coursh I'll gosh!

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:22.790
Huh?

00:12:22.790 --> 00:12:27.250
And that's a wrap! Thank you, please come again.

00:12:27.250 --> 00:12:29.370
I messed up till the very end?!

00:12:29.370 --> 00:12:31.450
The way out is right over there!

00:12:33.750 --> 00:12:35.120
Hey.

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:37.200
Did you tell her all those great things?

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:41.250
I just wasted all of my handshake tickets.

00:12:41.250 --> 00:12:44.160
I wanna start over!

00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:46.080
H-Hey, don't worry about it...

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:49.700
It's not fair! Why doesn't time go backwards?!

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:53.200
I mean... Things tend to stack up
because of that, but...

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:57.250
Maina!

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:10.540
Of coursh I'll gosh!

00:13:16.370 --> 00:13:17.830
You're the onwy...

00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:23.250
"ChamJam [Official] Blog has been updated."
"ChamJam TV appearance info"

00:13:24.660 --> 00:13:27.910
"Sorry this is so sudden! But I think we'll be
on TV just a tiny bit tonight on a special
program about the festival. I hope you guys watch."

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.910
"TV"
T-TV?!

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:34.660
"Can I come watch the show at your place
after I'm done with work, Kumasa?"

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.120
Uh...

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:38.290
"I think I might puke if I watch it alone"

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:39.660
"I won't even be able to watch it because
I'll be puking too much..."

00:13:39.660 --> 00:13:40.660
"I can't watch it alone. I'll die"

00:13:40.660 --> 00:13:43.660
"I'd rather watch it alone... I won't be able
to concentrate if you were here, Eripiyo"

00:13:43.660 --> 00:13:44.700
"They might only be on for a moment"

00:13:45.950 --> 00:13:48.200
"Can I come watch TV at your place, Motoi?"

00:13:48.200 --> 00:13:51.450
"If Sorane happened to see you at my place,
she'd get the wrong idea, so no"

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:54.000
Sorane has no idea where you live, Motoi!

00:13:54.000 --> 00:13:56.910
Eri, what are you yelling about? Keep it down.

00:13:56.910 --> 00:13:58.120
Miyu!

00:13:58.120 --> 00:14:01.330
Someone I really like is
going to be on TV tonight!

00:14:01.330 --> 00:14:03.330
--Wanna come over and wat--
--What?!

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:05.080
Since when do you have someone you like?!

00:14:05.080 --> 00:14:06.080
Huh?

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:10.370
S-Spring... three years ago...

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:13.910
So... Will you watch TV with me?

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:16.120
Totally! I love hearing about relationships!

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:21.870
--Another cup for today. Japanese Saké, Ogre Killer.
--I know I said I'd come over,

00:14:21.870 --> 00:14:23.500
--Another cup for today. Japanese Saké, Ogre Killer.
--but now that I actually thought about it,

00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:25.500
is there a need for me to watch this with you?

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:28.200
I mean, I have a TV at home.

00:14:28.200 --> 00:14:31.160
Well, I want to watch this with you, Miyu, okay?

00:14:31.160 --> 00:14:33.620
Because I just might puke!

00:14:33.620 --> 00:14:35.250
Uh, you can puke on your own.

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:39.120
I-It's about to start!

00:14:39.120 --> 00:14:43.540
Why are you so nervous?
I mean, you see this person all the time, right?

00:14:43.540 --> 00:14:47.500
I do! I do but seeing them on TV is special!

00:14:47.500 --> 00:14:51.500
Idols from all around Setouchi will
appear at the Setouchi Idol Festival!

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.290
It's finally that time of year again!

00:14:54.290 --> 00:14:57.250
Here's the group to look out for this festival.

00:14:57.250 --> 00:15:00.580
Hiroshima's very own Maple Doll!

00:15:00.580 --> 00:15:02.040
Hello!

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.750
Let's have a word from their leader, Mei.

00:15:04.750 --> 00:15:08.330
Sure! Of course I hope
everyone comes to see us,

00:15:08.330 --> 00:15:13.040
but I think this a great chance to discover
new and wonderful idols, too!

00:15:13.040 --> 00:15:15.750
Do you feel that any of them are your rivals?

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:18.830
Well... They're all really cute,

00:15:18.830 --> 00:15:22.040
but maybe Moko from Time Machine Pudding.

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:24.870
I can barely breathe anymore...

00:15:24.870 --> 00:15:27.790
Please just hurry up and get it over with!

00:15:27.790 --> 00:15:30.370
The person you like hasn't appeared yet, right?

00:15:30.370 --> 00:15:31.580
Why are you so...

00:15:31.580 --> 00:15:35.330
Because I know they're destined to be on TV!

00:15:35.330 --> 00:15:39.500
And my heart just isn't prepared for it yet!

00:15:39.500 --> 00:15:42.160
And that was Maple Doll!

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:42.450
Here are some of the other idol groups
that are set to appear!

00:15:42.450 --> 00:15:46.700
"The 16th Setouchi Idol Festival"
Here are some of the other idol groups
that are set to appear!

00:15:46.700 --> 00:15:48.870
What a wonderful lineup!

00:15:51.830 --> 00:15:54.830
Maina... Maina was...

00:15:54.830 --> 00:15:57.830
Maina was on TV!

00:15:57.830 --> 00:16:03.330
My... My little Maina! She's grown so much!

00:16:03.330 --> 00:16:06.040
You worked so hard! You are working so hard!

00:16:06.040 --> 00:16:09.250
I'm so happy I've loved you
for three years, Maina!

00:16:09.250 --> 00:16:13.410
Maina! I love your past, future, everything!

00:16:13.410 --> 00:16:17.040
Or rather, you were obviously shining
much brighter than the other girls!

00:16:17.040 --> 00:16:20.080
That just means you're destined to get
more fans all around the world!

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:23.750
Okay, I get that you like
some idol or something.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:26.750
I mean, I never judged anyone because of that...

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.620
But...

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:30.500
Man, you're being creepy about it.

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:39.330
She screamed and got all worked up on her own,
got exhausted, then went to sleep.

00:16:39.330 --> 00:16:41.040
You invited me over here, remember?

00:16:44.000 --> 00:16:47.250
"Idolize Me"
"Magical Fuyutaro"

00:16:48.580 --> 00:16:51.120
I'll idolize you with my magic!

00:16:51.120 --> 00:16:53.370
Magic... Magic... Magic...

00:16:56.250 --> 00:16:57.330
Miyu!

00:16:57.330 --> 00:16:59.250
So, what did you think yesterday?!

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:02.830
What do you mean? I couldn't even
tell who you were talking about.

00:17:02.830 --> 00:17:06.910
Seriously?! But I have no idea
when they'll be on TV again!

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:10.540
But, well... Because I was
watching TV at your house,

00:17:10.540 --> 00:17:12.250
I had an encounter of my own.

00:17:12.250 --> 00:17:14.750
I fell for someone, too.

00:17:14.750 --> 00:17:15.750
Huh?!

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:18.620
This is Fuyutaro!

00:17:18.620 --> 00:17:20.500
I'm head over heels for him right now!

00:17:20.500 --> 00:17:22.790
I'll idolize you!

00:17:22.790 --> 00:17:24.620
Really?! You went in that direction?!

00:17:24.620 --> 00:17:27.120
Bless his magical self!

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:30.330
But I mean... our relationship
is never meant to be.

00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:32.450
I love him with all my heart,

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:35.700
but the barrier of the LCD TV
is deeper than the Milky Way...

00:17:35.700 --> 00:17:37.700
Right?! I totally get you!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.750
What?! Don't you dare compare me to you!
I'll idolize the crap out of you!

00:17:40.750 --> 00:17:42.040
Y-You'll what?

00:17:42.040 --> 00:17:46.450
Just be thankful you live in the
same dimension as the one you like!

00:17:46.450 --> 00:17:48.500
M-My bad...

00:17:50.790 --> 00:17:52.290
Ready, and...

00:17:52.290 --> 00:17:53.330
"The 16th Setouchi Idol Festival"

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:56.160
All the numbers aren't that great.

00:17:56.160 --> 00:17:58.370
Do you think we'll be able
to see them from the front row?

00:17:58.370 --> 00:18:01.290
Well, it's a festival, so we should
be able to secure our spots.

00:18:01.290 --> 00:18:04.910
The fans will switch places in the crowd
depending on who they're there for.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.830
I see... But then again,

00:18:06.830 --> 00:18:11.290
I sorta want people who don't usually get
to see Cham to get a good view of them!

00:18:11.290 --> 00:18:14.370
Maina is so unbelievably cute up close!

00:18:14.370 --> 00:18:17.370
Of course, she's cute from far away, too!

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:19.910
Oh, yeah! Did you guys draw
for the new bromides?

00:18:19.910 --> 00:18:22.580
Maina's as cute as ever!

00:18:22.580 --> 00:18:24.500
Wait... You already have that many?!

00:18:24.500 --> 00:18:27.040
I'm just so thankful...

00:18:27.040 --> 00:18:28.370
Thankful?

00:18:28.370 --> 00:18:29.700
My friend told me that

00:18:29.700 --> 00:18:34.410
I should be thankful that the one I love
is in the same dimension as me.

00:18:34.410 --> 00:18:35.200
Wait, what?

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:36.200
For example...

00:18:36.200 --> 00:18:41.160
Just thinking about the fact that Maina
was breathing when they took this photo.

00:18:44.040 --> 00:18:46.120
It's so... amazing.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:48.080
How did this conversation get so low?

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:50.160
--Oh, it's so amazing!
--What?!

00:18:50.160 --> 00:18:53.120
The miracle of genetics! Bless!

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:58.750
I want so many others to feel this!

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:01.700
This is truly the closest miracle to me.

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:04.330
I'm not exactly sure if it's a miracle, but...

00:19:04.330 --> 00:19:08.160
I mean, you have an account,
so why don't you tweet about it?

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:10.870
Oh! So that's when you're supposed to use it!

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:13.250
You never really tweeted, have you?

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:17.750
I just made one because I was told Maina
would appreciate me having one.

00:19:17.750 --> 00:19:19.660
Okay, then...

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:24.370
What the heck am I supposed to tweet about?

00:19:24.370 --> 00:19:28.580
Er, what you were going on about
just a second ago is fine.

00:19:28.580 --> 00:19:31.410
But what if something bad happens to Maina

00:19:31.410 --> 00:19:34.040
because of some Maina info
I happen to tweet about?

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:37.700
Or what if someone says,
"Maina fans are creepy. Gross," or something?

00:19:37.700 --> 00:19:39.750
You're worried about that now?!

00:19:42.620 --> 00:19:45.330
Yeah! I think we're looking good.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:47.410
All right, break time!

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.620
Who died and made you leader, Aya?

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:08.870
Hey! Our dancing is really coming together!

00:20:08.870 --> 00:20:11.700
At this rate, I think we might
kick ass at the festival!

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:15.450
Heck yeah, we will!
That's exactly why we're practicing!

00:20:15.450 --> 00:20:17.790
Maybe our popularity will explode after this.

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:20.250
You bet it will! I'll make sure of it!

00:20:20.250 --> 00:20:24.000
I'm the only one who can't keep up.

00:20:24.000 --> 00:20:27.790
Am I really allowed to stand
on a big stage like that?

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:32.660
Do you feel that any of them are your rivals?

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:35.540
Well... They're all really cute,

00:20:35.540 --> 00:20:39.000
but maybe Moko from Time Machine Pudding.

00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:40.870
She's a really good singer and dancer,

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:45.660
and I hear that she likes mandarins
because she's from Ehime!

00:20:45.660 --> 00:20:52.450
I got excited for a second, thinking
Mei might've brought my name up.

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:57.370
Of course, she didn't have to.
I just got ahead of myself.

00:21:12.370 --> 00:21:14.910
"Eripiyo" "I wish I could see Maina right now."
No way! Eripiyo!

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:17.700
She's never tweeted before!

00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:19.830
"Eripiyo @mainaLOVE"
"I wish I could see Maina right now."

00:21:19.830 --> 00:21:21.660
"Eripiyo @mainaLOVE"
"I wish I could see Maina right now."
"New post"

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:23.040
"Why do I want to see her?
Because Maina is the best idol ever."

00:21:23.700 --> 00:21:27.950
"Why do I want to see her?
Because Maina is the best idol ever."

00:21:29.580 --> 00:21:31.580
"Why Maina is the best part 1: She's cute."

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:32.950
"Part 2: Her dancing is cute."

00:21:32.950 --> 00:21:34.330
"Part 3: The mole behind her ear is cute."

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:35.620
Huh?!

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:40.750
"Part 4: Her hand is so warm when I shake it."

00:21:40.750 --> 00:21:45.040
"Part 5: She always tries to find
something to blog about."

00:21:45.040 --> 00:21:48.080
"Part 6: Even if she didn't do well
in the popularity ranking,

00:21:48.080 --> 00:21:50.450
she didn't let that faze her and kept smiling."

00:21:50.450 --> 00:21:54.830
"Part 7: When she says, 'hello,'
the end sounds super cute!"

00:21:54.830 --> 00:21:57.450
"Part 8: The top of her head
is so cute when she bows..."

00:21:57.450 --> 00:21:59.450
"Part 24: Basically everything about her
is cute and lovable!!!"

00:22:01.450 --> 00:22:03.700
"Part 36: She's going to be appearing in a huge festival."
"Part 35: Because she makes me want to see her."

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:07.500
"Part 37: She gives me something
to look forward to."

00:22:09.500 --> 00:22:12.250
"Part 38: Thank you, Maina!"

00:22:13.290 --> 00:22:17.950
But... I'm nothing compared to
the other members of Cham...

00:22:32.500 --> 00:22:35.080
"If Maina made it to the Budokan someday"

00:24:05.040 --> 00:24:08.120
"Last episode"

00:24:08.120 --> 00:24:09.620
Mr. Yoshikawa, what in the world...

00:24:09.620 --> 00:24:11.580
I'm readying my stopwatch for the idol festival!

00:24:11.580 --> 00:24:13.160
But the next episode is the last one.

00:24:13.160 --> 00:24:14.830
D'oh! But I was so motivated!

00:24:14.830 --> 00:24:17.830
You only ever said, "Thank you very much!"
Mr. Yoshikawa.

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:20.000
"If My Favorite Pop Idol Made It to the Budokan"
Huh?! Th-Thank you very much!
